# CLAUDE.md — masnavi farsi → shahmukhi punjabi

## project

build a two-part web app for translating rumi's masnavi (book 4) from farsi into shahmukhi punjabi.

- **public reader** at `/` — displays approved translations, farsi left / shahmukhi punjabi right
- **private workbench** at `/admin` — password-gated translation tool for harkirat (sole user), where AI drafts couplets and harkirat surgically edits them couplet-by-couplet, then approves in batches of 10/25/50

reuse harkirat's existing masnavi reader site as the visual foundation. strip the english column. keep two-column layout (farsi + shahmukhi punjabi).

starting scope: book 4 only. ~3,800 couplets. ship book 4 fully before considering any other book.

